stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: POST /api/v1/platforms<br/>(is_active=TRUE)
    Active --> Active: PUT — INSERT new row<br/>same id, updated fields
    Active --> Inactive: DELETE — INSERT new row<br/>is_active=FALSE
    Inactive --> Active: POST again — INSERT<br/>new row, is_active=TRUE

    note right of Active
        Latest row: is_active=TRUE
        --
        Can register identifiers
        (POST /v1/identifiers).
        Lookup returns this row.
        Users auth via mTLS.
        Dataset GETs route here
        (platform.base_url).
        supports_subsetting flag
        drives XML vs subset API.
    end note

    note right of Inactive
        Latest row: is_active=FALSE
        --
        Lookup excludes this row
        (filter is_active=TRUE).
        Platform mTLS auth fails.
        Consignments rows stay;
        non-latest rows archived
        nightly by CronManager.
    end note
